  "description": "Cha Kang-Hyeon, Ga-Yeong’s blood relative and arch-nemesis who has been meddling in her love life since she was a child. For some reason, she has a bad feeling that this latest crush is going to fall apart because of Cha Kang-Hyeon, so she goes to a supposedly reputable tarot shop and buys a suspicious bracelet… \n\nWhy have I turned into Cha Kang-Hyeon?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
